# Leftover config from a previous deployment, removed in #87 (GitHub Actions
# workflows + Claude Code command/skill files). Ignored broadly so they cannot
# silently return. This repo is GitLab-native — CI lives in .gitlab-ci.yml and
# .gitlab/, CODEOWNERS in .gitlab/ — so .github/ is unused here. If a GitHub-side
# file is ever genuinely needed, un-ignore that specific path rather than removing
# this guard.
.claude
.github

